- **Updated Swarm Directive**: Changed the primary directive to "make money in reality no simulation" in [launch_swarm.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/launch_swarm.bat) and [swarm_configs.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/swarm_configs.ts).
